  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> »pomBasic« </h3> <h1> 适用于检测和测量任务的通用光学系统 </h1>",
   "body": "<p>需对切削刀具进行通用或针对性检测时，ZOLLER »pomBasic« 都能快速、轻松地提供精准结果：角度、半径、距离、切削刃质量、磨削纹路。选配漫射光源（LED平板灯）可灵活扩展透射光测量的应用范围，例如也可快速测量并记录外轮廓。</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#c3759\">测量</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#c3760\">»pomLightTube«</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/3/csm_pombasic_Anwendungen_Optik_37c41c5354.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c2193",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {
    "before": "small",
    "after": "small"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "overlay",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/2/csm_Pombasic_Anwendungen_2_a9c7717a63.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 996,
    "h": 836
   },
   "title": "测量",
   "text": "<p>»pomBasic«可在入射光中测量各类切削刀具（如钻头、铣刀、锯片、成型刀具和刀片）的所有相关参数。</p>",
   "ftype": "zoller_overlay",
   "id": "c3759",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "overlay",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/1/csm_Pombasic_Anwendungen_pomlighttube_2a_320e23ee45.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 996,
    "h": 644
   },
   "title": "»pomLightTube«",
   "text": "<p>对精密刀具上复杂几何形状进行最佳照明，是实现完美检测和测量的先决条件。 凭借设计独特的 ZOLLER »pomLightTube« 照明系统，即使面对通常难以照明的几何结构和反光表面，也能获得极其均匀的图像质量。</p>",
   "ftype": "zoller_overlay",
   "id": "c3760",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> »pomBasic MTI« </h3> <h2> “Micro”光学技术成就极致完美 </h2>",
   "body": "<p>ZOLLER »pomBasic MTI« 表示“微型刀具检测”（Micro Tool Inspection），提供紧凑型、贴近生产线的微型刀具检测与测量解决方案。 配备同轴照明的专用高分辨率微型摄像头，可对极小尺寸的刀具进行精确检测：其变焦镜头具备 125 倍至 1250 倍的放大倍率，能极其细致地捕捉微型刀具的细节。</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#c3761\">测量</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#c3762\">»pomLightTube«</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/f/csm_pombasicmicro_anwendungen_optik_b18922f2d7.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c2194",
   "bg": "black",
   "space": {
    "before": "small",
    "after": "small"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "overlay",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/f/csm_Pombasicmicro_Anwendungen_messungen_2_d4d4923e53.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 996,
    "h": 856
   },
   "title": "测量",
   "text": "<p>»pomBasic MTI« 基于 »pomBasic« 开发，具备相同的优势，可广泛应用于测量室、进料检验或直接在生产线上使用。</p>",
   "ftype": "zoller_overlay",
   "id": "c3761",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "overlay",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/e/csm_Pombasicmicro_Anwendungen_pomlighttube_2_eda92f127c.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 996,
    "h": 872
   },
   "title": "微型刀具检测",
   "text": "<p>借助 ZOLLER »pomBasic MTI«，您可以以极高的精度检测哪怕是最微小的细节 — 我们称之为 ZOLLER 的卓越性能，旨在确保您的微型刀具始终如一的品质。</p>",
   "ftype": "zoller_overlay",
   "id": "c3762",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> 全方位刀具检测 </h2>",
   "body": "<p>由助手引导的测量流程、一键生成完整的检测报告，以及在ZOLLER中央刀具数据库z.One中针对特定刀具管理所有参数，这些功能可随时确保高效的制造流程和可追溯的质量。</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ch/%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A/%E8%81%94%E7%B3%BB%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC\">立即咨询</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://myzoller.com/de/de/expert/booking/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">1对1专家咨询</a></p>",
